  "title": "Meet Our New Access Control Systems API & SDK",
  "summary": "Seam has launched a new API for integrating physical access control systems like Salto, Latch, and Assa Abloy, enabling developers to easily issue mobile keys, PIN codes, and plastic cards. The API simplifies complex integrations and comes with native iOS and Android SDKs, helping software and AI agents grant access across a growing list of supported systems.",
